          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገር ፡ እንነግራችኋለን ፡ (ውእቱ ፡ ዘሰማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕናሁ ፡ በእዘኒነ) ፡ አነ ፡ በአብ ፡ ወአብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብየ ፡ አነ ፡ ወአብ ፡ አሐዱ ፡ ንሕነ ፡ ብሎ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲያስተምር ፡ የሰማነው ፡ እሱ ፡ ነው ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወዘርኢናሁ ፡ በአዕይንቲነ ፡ እስመ ፡ ስም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐ ፡ ቃላቲሁ ፡ ምግባሩ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ እንዲል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አነ ፡ በአብ ፡ ወአብ ፡ ብየ ፡ አነ ፡ ወአብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሐዱ ፡ ንሕነ ፡ ብሎ ፡ የተናገረውን ፡ የህ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልውናውን ፡ ነገር ፡ በሥራው ፡ ለማስረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳት ፡ የአራት ፡ ቀን ፡ ሬሳ ፡ አላዛርን ፡ የዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለት ፡ ሬሳ ፡ ወለተ ፡ ኢያኢሮስን ፡ ወልደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መበለትን ፡ ሲያስነሣ ፡ ያየነው ፡ እሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ። ወዘጠየቅናሁ ፡ ወዘገሠሣሁ ፡ እደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዊነ ፡ በእንተ ፡ ነገረ ፡ ሕይወት ። ህልውና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን፡ስለማወቅ፡በቃላችን፡ጠይቀን፡የተረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳነው ፡ እሱ ፡ ነው፡(ጥቅ)፡ሀሎኑ ፡ እዴሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለኢዮአብ ፡ በዝ ፡ ነገርኪ ፡ በእደ ፡ ሙሴ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእደ ፡ ካህናት ፡ እንዲል ። ሐተታ ፡ ፊል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጶስ፡ አርእየነሁ ፡ ለአብ ፡ ወየአክለነ ፡ ቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለው ፡ ዘመጠነ፡ ዝ ፡ መዋዕል፡ ሀሎኩ፡ ም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስሌክሙ ፡ ኢያእመርከኒኑ ፡ ፊልጶስ ፡ ዘር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እየ ፡ ኪያየ ፡ ርእዮ ፡ ለአቡየ ፡ ብሎታል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(እስመ ፡ ሕይወት ፡ ተዐውቀት ፡ ለነ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ህልውና ፡ ታውቃልናለችና ፡ ተረድታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናለችና ። (ወሰምዐ ፡ ኮነ) ፡ መስክርናት ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወውእቱ ፡ ቃል ፡ ኀበ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውእቱ ፡ ብለን ። ወንዜንወክሙ ፡ ንሕነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕይወተ። ነአምን ፡ ከመ ፡ አብ ፡ ህልው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በወልድ ፡ ወበመንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ወነአም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን ፡ ከመ ፡ ወልድ ፡ ህልው ፡ በአብ ፡ ወበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ወነአምን ፡ ከመ ፡ መን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ህልው ፡ በአብ ፡ ወበወል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድ ፡ ህልዋን ፡ እሙንቱ ፡ በአብ ፡ እንዘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሄልዉ ፡ በበአካላቲሆሙ ፡ እንዲል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከአብ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ የምትሆን ፡ ህልውና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የዘለዓለም፡ ድኅነት፡ እንደ፡ ሆነች ፡ እንነግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራችኋለን ፤ ወዛቲ ፡ ይእቲ ፡ ሕይወት ፡ ዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለዓለም ፡ ከመ ፡ ያእምሩከ ፡ ለከ ፡ ለ፩ ፡ አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምላከ ፡ ጽድቅ ፡ ብሏል ፤ ብለን ። (ወተዐ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውቀት ፡ ለነ ፡ ወርኢናሃ) ፡ ህልውና ፡ ታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውቃልናለች ፡ ተረድታናለችና ፤ (ወሰማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕናሃ) ፡ ወበከመ ፡ ዘፈነወኒ ፡ አብ ፡ ሕያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ አነኒ ፡ ሕያው ፡ በእንተ፡ አብ ፡ ብሎ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲያስተምር ፡ ከቃሉ ፡ ሰምተናታልና።አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ ንዜንወክሙ ፡ በቅድምና ፡ የነበረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የእሱን ፡ የሥጋዌውን ፡ ነገር፡ እንነግራችኋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለን ፤ (ውእቱ ፡ ዘሰማዕናሁ) ፡ ወፃእኩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እምአብ ፡ ወመጻእኩ ፡ አቡየ ፡ ፈነወኒ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወአነ ፡ ተፈኖኩ ፡ ብሎ ፡ ሲናገር ፡ የሰማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ እሱ ፡ ነው ። (ወዘርኢናሁ) ፡ ባጭ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ር ፡ ቁመት ፡ በጠባብ ፡ ደረት ፡ ተወስኖ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲያስተምር ፡ ያየነው ፡ እሱ ፡ ነው ። (ወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘገሠሣሁ) ፡ በጃችን ፡ ዳሰን ፡ የተረዳነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሱ ፡ ነው ። ሐተታ፡ ሦስት፡ ዓመት ፡ ከሦ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስት ፡ ወር ፡ አብሯቸው ፡ ሲኖር ፡ በማና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ ምክንያት ፡ ይዳስሱት ፡ ነበረና ፡ (እ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስመ፡ ሕይወት)፡ሥጋዌ፡ታውቃልናለችና፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ወሰምዐ፡ ኮነ)፡መስክርናት፡ውእቱ፡ ቃል፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥጋ ፡ኮነ፡ ብለን፡ እስመ፡በፈቃዱ፡ ወበሥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምረተ፡አቡሁ፡ወመንፈስ፡ቅዱስ፡መጽአ፡እ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንዲል።(ወንዜንወክሙ) ፡ በአብ ፡ ፈቃድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
